our.\n277\t\n278\t## 5. Finish\n279\t\n280\tRun, from the `translation/` directory:\n281\t\n282\t```\n283\tcargo build --release 2>&1 | tail -60\n284\t```\n285\t\n286\tErrors in *other* modules (not yet written) are expected and are fine;\n287\t**errors in your own file are not** — fix them. Iterate until your file is\n288\tfree of errors. Report at the end: the module path you wrote, the number of\n289\tfunctions translated, and any C construct you were unsure about.\n290\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_011JmJRbmYqPhk6WPnd9KJ6X","session_id":"bedb3620-db7f-4287-b934-614ec17ac76e","uuid":"daca7258-0654-49aa-b7eb-ecbe7ed8fbc2","timestamp":"2026-08-31T12:35:30.536Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Translate pngtrans.c"}
