xel depth\"` when `pixel_depth & 7`. The other three are `\"internal row logic error\"`, `\"internal row size calculation error\"`, `\"internal row width error\"`.\n- Interlace helpers used from the prelude: `png_pass_start_col`, `png_pass_col_offset`, `png_pass_inc`. `png_pass_start`/`ystart`/`yinc` were not needed by this range.\n- Pointer decrements that can legitimately step one element before `row` at the end of the expansion loops (`dp--`, `sp--`, `dp -= pixel_bytes`) use `wrapping_sub` rather than `sub`; identical codegen, avoids UB-flagged out-of-bounds `offset`.","usage":{"total_tokens":96688,"tool_uses":21,"duration_ms":328054},"uuid":"edf3b92b-db00-44a1-837d-f1d4c22546ae","session_id":"bedb3620-db7f-4287-b934-614ec17ac76e"}
